        "SRC-001221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY (Nov 2025): five stories, 57 feet tall; community room and fitness center overlooking a second-level courtyard. The Registry (Nov 2025) reports an estimated construction cost of $60.8 million and a preliminary application by Eden Housing.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003218",
        "SRC-003220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Walking Redwood City (Jul 2026): Lane Partners will buy 705 Veterans Blvd and deed it to Eden Housing once its 1900 Broadway office project moves forward; existing commercial leases run through 2026, one into 2027, so construction is not expected before 2028.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Patch (Aug 2026): council approved the site swap 4-1, replacing a 71-unit affordable project at 847 Woodside Rd that Eden said was no longer economically feasible.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003221"
      ]
    }
